menu "Attendance"

    config ATTEND_SEED_DEDUP_MIN
        int "Seed for the window that swallows a second stamp (minutes)"
        default 5
        range 1 720
        help
            Written to NVS key attend/dedup_min on the first boot only
            (KEHOACH 6.2.1); afterwards the kiosk reads NVS and SET_CONFIG
            changes it. A second scan inside the window still opens the
            door, it just writes no record (KEHOACH 4.5.5f).

    config ATTEND_SEED_ALLOW_NO_SPOOF
        bool "Seed for granting on a negative liveness score"
        default n
        help
            Written to NVS key attend/allow_no_spoof on the first boot only.
            A kiosk that cannot tell a face from a photo should not open a
            door, so this is for a bench running an image with no spoof
            branch (KEHOACH 4.5.5f).

endmenu
